+// Plutonium: the status cluster, at the title bar's right edge, where it shows
+// whatever else is open (sidebar hidden, panel maximized, chat folded): the
+// time, the battery when it isn't on AC, and an icon only for something
+// wrong (offline, muted). A click opens quick settings: the date and a
+// calendar, volume and brightness, Wi-Fi and Bluetooth, what's playing, the
+// battery, and lock, suspend, log out, restart and power off. Over the
+// helper's desktop services (systemServices.ts); only in the Plutonium shell.
+//
+// Its width is --plutonium-status-width on the document: the title bar's
+// other right-hand controls (--workspace-controls-right) and the headers they
+// sit over make room for it.
